<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHP" style="id">- Nyanja Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Afilipi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kalata ya Poolo kwa Afilipi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Afilipi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Afil</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kalata ya poolo kwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Afilipi</para>
  <para style="imt">Mau ya uchogolelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Poolo yapo wadali mundende wadalemba kalata kwa okhulupila adali ku filipi kuchaka cha sitini ni mojha pambuyo pakubadwa Yesu Muomboli 1:13. Ikulupilika nyengo imeneyo wadali ku Loma. Kalata ii idalembedwa kwa gulu la wandhu amkhulupila Kilisito adali kumujhi wa Filipi. Tikoza kujhi yaluza vindhu vochepa kuusu mujhi wa Filipi mu chikalakala cha Vichito va Atumwi. Filipi udali mujhi waukulu wa jimbo la Makedonia. Ili lidali gulu la wandhu amkhulupila Kilisito loyamba kuyambichidwa mu malo ya Mekidonia. Poolo ni Sila adayambicha gulu la wandhu amkhulupila Kilisito yapo adali pamojhi ni adamangidwa mdende pamojhi usiku onjhe yapo adali mu mujhio Vichito 16.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ikhozeka Poolo wadali ni mateyake pa kulemba kalata ii. Wadatumila kalata ii ngati malo ya kwaayamika kwa mbhaso adamtumila yapo adavela wali mndende 4:10-19. Ndiponjho wadakhoza kwajhiwicha kuusu umo wadali mndende niwadatumila kalata imeneyo kwatambulila Timoseo ni Epafulod kwa gulu la wandhu amkhulupila Kilisito 2:19-30 ili wakalibishe ni kwaalemekeza achogoleli wao.</para>
  <para style="iot">Yayo yalimo muchikalakala ichi</para>
  <para style="io">Poolo wayamba kulemba kalata yake kwa kulonjela gulu la wandhu amkhulupila Kilisito uwo wali mumujhi wa Filipi 1:1-2.</para>
  <para style="io">Pambuyo wapacha nghani za yayo yamzungulila ni vindhu vina ivo wadaona vimchaucha.</para>
  <para style="io">Ndiipo wapacha yayo afunika kuchita ili alame muumoyo wa muomboli kwa vichito 3:1-4,9.</para>
  <para style="io">Potela Poolo waliyamika gulu la wamndhu amkhulupila Kilisito wa Afilipi kwa mbhaso adamtumila ni wapeleka moni 4:10-23.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHP 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 1:1" />Poolo ni Timoseo, atumiki a Yesu muomboli</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PHP 1:1">Kwa anyiimwe wandhu a Amnungu a ku Filipi kupitila Yesu Kilisito, pamojhi ni achogoleli agulu la wandhu amkhulupila Kilisito ni anyiyawo waatangatila.<verse eid="PHP 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 1:2" />Ubwino wa Amnungu ni mtendele uchokela kwa Atate ni Ambuye Yesu Muomboli.<verse eid="PHP 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Poolo waapembhela achogoleli wake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 1:3" />Niyamika Mnungu wanga kila ndhawi nikakukumbukilani, <verse eid="PHP 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 1:4" />kila ndhawi mmapembhelo yanga yonjhe nikupembhelani kwa kukondwa <verse eid="PHP 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 1:5" />ndande ya kuthangatila kwanu kulalikila Uthenga Wabwino kuyambila siku loyamba mbaka lelo. <verse eid="PHP 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 1:6" />Nikhulupila kuti Mnungu waiyamba njhito ii ya bwino mmitima mwanu siwaiendeleze mbaka ikwanile musiku ijha ya Kilisito Yesu. <verse eid="PHP 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 1:7" />Chimwecho ndeumo nifunikila kukuganizilani mumtima mwanga, ndande pa kumangidwa kwanga kwa njhito yo lalikila Uthenga Wabwino mwaonjhe mwatangatilana niine. <verse eid="PHP 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 1:8" />Mnungu wajhiwa kuti nifuna kupunda kukuonani nikukondani mwaonjhe kwa chikondi cha Kilisito Yesu.<verse eid="PHP 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 1:9" />Iili nde pembhelo langa kuti chikondi chanu chichuluke kupunda nikupundichicha, mwanjelu ni kujhiwa konjhe, <verse eid="PHP 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 1:10" />ili mukhoze kusanghula vindhu vabwino, mkhale bwino, popande lawama mbhaka siku la Muomboli. <verse eid="PHP 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 1:11" />Umoyo wanu siujhale vindhu vabwino ivo Yesu Muomboli mwene siwakupacheni kwa ulemelelo ni matamando ya Mnungu.<verse eid="PHP 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muomboli ndewatipacha umoyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 1:12" />Okhulupila achanjanga, nifuna mujhiwe kuti vindhu vonjhe vanipata uzene vanitangatila kulalikila Uthenga Wabwino. <verse eid="PHP 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 1:13" />Kuchokana ni yamenyo, alonda onjhe anyumba ya Ufumu pamojhi ni wina, ajhiwa nalimndende ndande nimtumikila Kilisito. <verse eid="PHP 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 1:14" />Ndande ya kumangidwa kwanga kwa achita Okhulupilila ambili akhale ni chikhulupi kwa Ambuye, ata apata mbhavu yolalikila uthenga wa Mnungu popande mandha.<verse eid="PHP 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 1:15" />zene kuti akumojhi amulalikila Kilisito ndande ali ninjhanje ni ndewo, nambho wina amulalikila Kilisito kwa ubwino. <verse eid="PHP 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 1:16" />Anyiyawa amulalikila kwa chikondi, ndande ajhiwa nalimuno mndende ndande yokhengelela Uthenga Wabwino, <verse eid="PHP 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 1:17" />nambho wina amulalikila Kilisito ndande afuna kujhikweza achina wene, chimwecho, aganizila sachuluche mavuto yanga mndende.<verse eid="PHP 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 1:18" />Nambho sivinibwela ine, nikondwa ikakhalape wandhu amulalikila Kilisito kwa kila mtundu, ikhale kwa ubwino kapina kwa kuipa. Ni siniendekele kukondwa, <verse eid="PHP 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 1:19" />pakuti, nijhiwa kwa kupembha kwanu, ni kutangatilidwa ni Mzimu wa Yesu Kilisito, yajha yadanipata ine siyang'anamuke kukhala uomboli. <verse eid="PHP 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 1:20" />hamu yanga yaikulu ni nichikhulupi changa nikuti, sinilenga mwano, niliniuhakika siniyendekele kukhala niujhasili wa kulalikila Uthenga Wabwino, kwa ufulu ngati umo nili, ni Kilisito siwatamandidwe kwaumo nichitila muthupu langa ikhale nilame kapina sinimwalile. <verse eid="PHP 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 1:21" />Kwanga kulama Nikilisito ni nikamwalila sinipate kupunda. <verse eid="PHP 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 1:22" />Nambho ngati nikaendekela kukhala wamoyo kwa thupi, kwanga ili nindande ya kwachitila njhito Ambuye, basi sinijhiwa icho sinichisanghe. <verse eid="PHP 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 1:23" />Nazingilidwa ni vindhu viwili vilingana, nikhumbila kusiya kukhala niumoyo uwu nikhale pamojhi Nikilisito, pakuti nichindhu chabwino kupunda, <verse eid="PHP 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 1:24" />nambho nichindhu chamate kupunda kwanu ngati nikaendekela kukhala wamoyo. <verse eid="PHP 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 1:25" />Nipakuti nikhulupila ili, nijhiwa niyendekele kukhala pamojhi namwe mwaonjhe ili mpate kukula ni kukhala ni kukhala ni chimwemwe muchikhulupi chanu, <verse eid="PHP 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 1:26" />ili kuti, chimwemwe chanu chikhale chambili mwa Kilisito Yesu, kwandande yanga kwa kujha kwanganjho kwanu.<verse eid="PHP 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 1:27" />Kupitilila yonjhe, lalilonjhe silichokele, muchite ngati umo yali mafuno ya Uthenga Wabwino wa Yesu Kilisito, ili kuti nikajha kapina nikasiya nivele yaya kuti mwaima nganganga mu mzimu mmojhi, maganizo, ni mugwililila chikhulupi chimojhi ndande ya Uthenga Wabwino. <verse eid="PHP 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 1:28" />Msadaaopa adani wanu, nambho chikhulupi chanu chazene sichikhale ngati chizindikilo kwa anyiiwo kuti sayomwe nambho anyiimwe simulamichidwe ni Mnungu. <verse eid="PHP 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 1:29" />Kwanu mwapachidwa mwawi ndande ya kumtumikila Kilisito, osati kwa kukhulupililape nambho kuvutika ndande ya Kilisito. <verse eid="PHP 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 1:30" />Pakuti chipano, mgwilizana niine pakubula nghondo, nghondo izi ndezijha mudaziona ndinibulana pajha poyamba, ndiizo nikali kubulana chipano ngati umo muvelela.<verse eid="PHP 1:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PHP 2" />
  <para style="s">Kunyenyekela ni Ukulu wa Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 2:1" />Kukakhala ni chindhu chalichonjhe cha kukutilani mtima kwa kulunjidwa Nikilisito, kukakhala ni mtendele walionjhe wa chikondi. Kugwilizana ni Mzimu, lika khalapo lisungu ni kulekelela wina. <verse eid="PHP 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 2:2" />Chitani yajha siyakwaniliche chimwemwe changa, ili mukhale ni kugwilizana, chikondi chimojhi, mtima umojhi ni kuganizila pamojhi. <verse eid="PHP 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 2:3" />Msada chita chindhu chalichonjhe kwandane yanu kapina kujidamila, ila kwa kunyenyekela kila mmojhi wamuone mnjake wamate kupita iye. <verse eid="PHP 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 2:4" />Kila mmojhi siwadajhipenya kupata kwake mwenepe, nambho wapenye kupata kwa mnjake. <verse eid="PHP 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 2:5" />Mukhale chimchijha ngati mujha muda khalilala ni Kilisito Yesu.<verse eid="PHP 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 2:6" />Iye kwa chiyambo wadali Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:6">siwadaone kujha kulingana ni Mnungu.<verse eid="PHP 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 2:7" />Iye wadajhichita si kandhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:7">wadajhichita walingana ni mbowa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:7">Wadali ngati wandhu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:7">wadaonekana ngati mundhu.<verse eid="PHP 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 2:8" />Wadanyenyekela ni kuvomela kumwalila</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:8">nyifa ya pamtanda.<verse eid="PHP 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 2:9" />Ndande imeneyo Mnungu adamwika pamwamba kupunda</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:9">nikumpacha jhina lalikulu kupitilila kila jhina.<verse eid="PHP 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 2:10" />Ili pa jhina la yesu kila mundhu walambile</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:10">kila chindhu cha kumwamba, pajhiko la panjhi, ni vapanjhi pa jhiko,<verse eid="PHP 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 2:11" />ni kila lilime livomele kuti YESU KILISITO NI AMBUYE,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:11">pa ulemelelo wa a Mnungu Atate.<verse eid="PHP 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dangalila la Jhiko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 2:12" />Nchimwecho okondedwa, yapo nidalinamwe mudanilemekeza masiku yonjhe, atachipano yapo nali patali namwe endekelani kulemekeza, chitani njhito kwa mandha ni kutendhemela ndande ya kuomboledwa kwanu, <verse eid="PHP 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 2:13" />pakuti Mnungu ndeuyo wachita njhito mukati mwanu, nikukupachani kukhoza nikuchita kwanu kwa kuchita chijha akufuna uchite.<verse eid="PHP 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 2:14" />Yachiteni yonjhe popande kudandaula wala kulimbana, <verse eid="PHP 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 2:15" />ili mkhale wana wa Mnungu mulibe lawama ni hatiya, ata ngati mukhala nikuzungulilidwa niwandhu anyiyawo akhala mujhiko loyipa ni lotayika simung'azikile pakati pao ngati umo ndhondwa zing'azila pajhiko, <verse eid="PHP 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 2:16" />muka uzila mawu ya umoyo nipamenepo nde yapo sinione ufulu siku la Kilisito kuti kulindilila ni njhita yanga vidachitike chajhe.<verse eid="PHP 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 2:17" />Atangati sinichochedwe njhembe pamojhi nichikhulupi chanu chili ngati njhembe kwa Mnungu, basi nikondwela kupunda kukugwilizani anyiimwe mwaonjhe chimwemwe chimenecho. <verse eid="PHP 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 2:18" />Nchimwecho namwe mfunika kukondwa ni kunigwiliza ine chimwemwe chanu.<verse eid="PHP 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Timoseo ni Epaflodito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 2:19" />Nikhulupila mwa Ambuye Yesu kumtuma Timoseo posachedwa yapa wajhe kwanu, kuti nitilidwe mtima kwa kupata nghani zanu. <verse eid="PHP 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 2:20" />Nilibe Mundhu mwina ngati timoseo uyo siwakupnyeleleni. <verse eid="PHP 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 2:21" />kila mmojhi wachita vindhu vake mumalo mwochita vindhu va Yesu Kilisito, <verse eid="PHP 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 2:22" />nambho mwachinawene mujhiwa umo timoseo wadajhichimikiza mwene, pakuti watumika pamojhi ni ine kulalikila Uthenga Wabwino. <verse eid="PHP 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 2:23" />Chimwecho nikhulupila kumtuma malakamojhi nikango jhiwa vindhu vanga umovikhalile. <verse eid="PHP 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 2:24" />Nane nikhulupila mwa Ambuye kuti nane sinijhe posachidwa.<verse eid="PHP 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 2:25" />Naona nafunika kumtuma kwanu mbale wathu Epafulodito, uyo mtumiki mnjanga, ni asikali mnjanga tenanjho nimtumiki mnjanu mudamtuma ili wani thangatile yapo nifuna mthandizo. <verse eid="PHP 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 2:26" />Wali ni khumbilo lalikulu lakukuonani anyiimwe mwaonjhe, wadandaula kupunda ndande anyiimwe mudavela wamadwala, <verse eid="PHP 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 2:27" />Yetudi wamadwala mbaka jhenje lokumbakumba, nambho Amnungu adamlengela lisungu niopande iyepe nambho ataine adanilengela lisungu nisidakhala ni chisoni. <verse eid="PHP 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 2:28" />Chimwecho nichita msanga kumtuma ili yapo simumuonenjho mukhale ni chimwemwe niine nichepe chisoni. <verse eid="PHP 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 2:29" />Mlandileni iye kwa chimwemwe mwa Ambuye, mwalemekeze wandhu ali ngati Epaflodito, <verse eid="PHP 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 2:30" />wafunika kulemekezedwa ndande wamafuna kumwalila yapo wama lalikila Uthenga Wabwino, wadaika umoyo wake iliwakhoze kunipacha ine mtandizo uwo anyiimwe simudakhoze kunipacha.<verse eid="PHP 2:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PHP 3" />
  <para style="s">Uadilifu wa zene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 3:1" />Mmatelo, abale wanga mukhale ni chimwemwe mwa kulunjana ni Ambuye. Sinilema kubwelela yajha nidalemba poyamba pakuti yakuthangatileni. <verse eid="PHP 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 3:2" />Mujhipenyelele ni agalu, ni anyiwajha achita vichito voipa, anyiyawo adula matupi yao. <verse eid="PHP 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 3:3" />Ife nde wandhu tali amdulidwe azene, osati anyiwo, pakuti ife timulambila Mnungu mwa Mumzimu, siti penya kwa mtundu uwo tili kwa kubadwa, kapina kwa yajha tayakwanilicha, tijhivunila ife kuchogozedwa ni Kilisito Yesu. <verse eid="PHP 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 3:4" />Ngati mundhu waliyonjhe wakaganiza wali ni ndande zokhulupilila thupi inenamwene nili nindande za kukhulupila thupi kupita iye. <verse eid="PHP 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 3:5" />Nidadulidwa siku la nane. Ine ni mu Izilaeli wa fuko la Benjamini, Mwebulania wa Waebulania. Kwanghani ya thauko ine ni Falisayo, <verse eid="PHP 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 3:6" />kwanghani za bidii nida vuticha gulu la wandhu amkhulupila Kilisito, panghani ya kuchata thauko ine sinida lakwe. <verse eid="PHP 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 3:7" />Vindhu vijha vidali ni pindu kwanga chipano niviona vopande mate ndande ya Muomboli. <verse eid="PHP 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 3:8" />Kupitilila yameneyo niwelenga vindhu vimenevo sinipata nikailinganicha ni kupata lalikulu lipitilila mwa pakumjhiwa Kilisito Yesu Ambuye wanga. Ndande yake navomela kusiya kila kandhu nayaona yalibe mate ili nimpate Muomboli <verse eid="PHP 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 3:9" />nane nilunjane nayo. Nisidajhi vomela namwene kwa kuchata thauko ila ijha ipezeka kwa chikhulupi mwa Kilisito kuvoleka kuchokela kwa Mnungu kwa chikhulupi. <verse eid="PHP 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 3:10" />Nifuna kumjhiwa Kilisito ni mbhavu za kuhyuka kwake ni kuchitika kwa mavuto yake ili nilingane nayo kuyachita, <verse eid="PHP 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 3:11" />ni nikhulupila nanenjho nihyukichidwe.<verse eid="PHP 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutamangila Ganizo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 3:12" />Sinijhidamila kuti natho koza iyayi niyendekela kuti nipheze chijha kwa ndande yake Kilisito Yesu watho nipata ine. <verse eid="PHP 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 3:13" />Abale sinijhi welenga kuti natopata pindu, nambho chindhu chimojhi nichita, niya iwala yajha yapita niyendekela kuyachita yamchogolo. <verse eid="PHP 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 3:14" />Niyendekela kuchita chijha nifunika ili nipate pindu ilo lili kutanidwa ni Mnungu mwa kupitila Kilisito Yesu.<verse eid="PHP 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 3:15" />Ife taonjhe takwima mwa mumzimu tiganize chindhu ichi. Atamkaganiza chindhu china Mnungu siwa aliike padanga nilimenelo nalo. <verse eid="PHP 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 3:16" />Nambho tilisunge kupunda lijha tauko likwanilicha.<verse eid="PHP 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 3:17" />Chatani fanizo langa ni kwapenya anyiwajha achatiza fanizo limenelo. <verse eid="PHP 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 3:18" />Natho kukambilani chindhu ichi kambili chipano nibwelezanjho kwa kulila wandhu ambili akhala ngati adani a mtanda wa Kilisito. <verse eid="PHP 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 3:19" />Kuthela kwa wandhu amenewo ni kulala, Mnungu wao ni mimba ni ulemelelo wao ni njhoni ni maganizo yawo yaganiza vindhu va mjhiko. <verse eid="PHP 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 3:20" />Nambho, kukhomo kwatu kumwamba, nafe timlindilila kwa khumbilo Kilisito kuchokela kumwamba, mate yake Ambuye Yesu Kilisito. <verse eid="PHP 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 3:21" />Yawo siang'anamule mathupi yathu ya kumwalila ili tipate thupi lake losa mwalile kwa kukhoza kujha wakhoza kuviika vindhu vonjhe paulamulo wake.<verse eid="PHP 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PHP 4" />
  <para style="s">Maelezo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 4:1" />Nchimwecho abale wanga, nikukondani nikhumbila kupunda kukuonani anyiimwe muli chikondi changa ni mbhaso yanga, chimwechi ndeumo mfunika kukhala nganganga ni Ambuye anyiimwe nikukondani.<verse eid="PHP 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 4:2" />Nialilila Euodia ni Sintike, nikupembhani mgwilizane ngati abale mwa Ambuye. <verse eid="PHP 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 4:3" />Yeetu nikupembhanjho, iwe wakulupila kwatangatila wachikazi anyiyawa ainjili pamojhi niine, Kilimenti ni atumiki anjanga winanjho, anyiyawo mayina yawo yalembedwa muchikalakala cha umoyo.<verse eid="PHP 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 4:4" />Chimwemwe chanu mwa Ambuye kwambili. Nikamba muchimwemwe!<verse eid="PHP 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 4:5" />Upole wanu ujhiwike ni wandhu onjhe. Ambuye ali pafupi. <verse eid="PHP 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 4:6" />Msadachita mandha pa chindhu chalichonjhe, nambho pa kila chindhu, pa kwapembha Mnungu mwa mayamiko, ni mapembhelo yanu siya jhuwike. <verse eid="PHP 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 4:7" />Ni mtendele wa Amnungu, upitilila njelu zonjhe, zikusungeni mitima yanu, ni njelu zanu, mwa Kilisito Yesu.<verse eid="PHP 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 4:8" />Potela mpenye vindhu vazene, ni yamate, yavomeleka, yaelecheka, yakhadwa ni yaulemu. <verse eid="PHP 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 4:9" />Vindhu vonjhe mwajiyaluza kwanga kapina kuyalandila kapina kuyavela kapina kuyaona, yachiteni yameneyo. Ni Mnungu watupacha mtendele siwakhale pamojhi nianyiimwe.<verse eid="PHP 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mayamiko kwa njhembe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 4:10" />Nili nichimwemwe kupunda mwa Ambuye, nchimwecho mwayambanjho kunitumikla, zene mwayamba kuniganizila, nambho simudapheze kuchita chimwecho <verse eid="PHP 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 4:11" />Sinikamba nchimwechi ndande nifuna iyayi, pakuti nilizika kwa umo siikhalile. <verse eid="PHP 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 4:12" />Nijhiwa umo ikhalila pajha ukhala opande kandhu, ni ukakhala ni kandhu, najiyaluza nikhale nacho, kapina nikhale ni njala, chikhale chambili, kapina chochepekela. <verse eid="PHP 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 4:13" />Nikhoza kuchita vindhu vonjhe mwa iye wanipacha mbhavu.<verse eid="PHP 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 4:14" />Atamchimwecho, anyiimwe mwachita bwino kugwilizana mwa mavuto yanga. <verse eid="PHP 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 4:15" />Ata anyiimwe Afilipi mujhiwa mmayambo mwo lalikila Injili pajha nimaachoka ku Makedonia palibe wandhu okhulupilila wina adanithangatila kuusu kuchocha ni kulandila ila anyiimwe mweka. <verse eid="PHP 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 4:16" />Pakuti ata kujha ku Selonike mdani pacha mtandizo mala kambili. <verse eid="PHP 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 4:17" />Osati nikhumbila ijha mbhaso, nambho nikhumbila mbhaso ichuluke kwanu. <verse eid="PHP 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 4:18" />Nalandila kila kandhu, kupitila Epafulodito nambho vachulukila, nalandila kwa Epafulodito vindhu vachoka kwanu, ndalama ni Mnungu avivomela. <verse eid="PHP 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 4:19" />Ni Mnungu wanga siakupacheni kila icho mufuna, kwa umo ali Opata mwa ufulu, wa Kilisito Yesu. <verse eid="PHP 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 4:20" />Chipano wakwezedwe Mnungu ni Atate muya ni muyaya ikhale chimwecho.<verse eid="PHP 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Moni zothela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 4:21" />Muni lonjelele aikidwa kwa kulalikila Uthenga Wabwino wa Kilisito. Abale ali pamojhi niine akulonjelani. <verse eid="PHP 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 4:22" />Ulonjeledwa ni aikidwa kwa njhito asa anyiwajha a nyumba ya chifumu ya Kaisali.<verse eid="PHP 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 4:23" />Mwachitilidwa ubwino wa Ambuye Yesu Kilisito pamojhi ni mzimu wanu.<verse eid="PHP 4:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 4" />
</usx>